+# A minimizing flux sector and its exact zero-penalty dispersion
+
+**Date:** 2026-09-08  
+**Type:** bounded_theorem  
+**Status:** conditional-support
+
+For the supplied uniform zero-penalty native Hamiltonian, a specified magnetic sector attains the global finite-volume ground energy. This conclusion imports the Macris–Nachtergaele reflection theorem; the native axioms do not select the Hamiltonian or its parameters. Canonical edge orientations then give its exact finite-torus dispersion.
